No change to:
- P3 candidate grammar or candidate identities;
- T1 V8/W1 V8 bytes or semantics;
- PC6/PIT/source definitions;
- estimator/evaluator;
- thresholds;
- multiplicity procedure;
- candidate count/order;
- label definitions;
- evidence-domain definitions;
- H0 reporting semantics;
- any decision based on observed real P3 outcomes.

